{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Woodrow the Old Piano",
    "steam_appid": 1667090,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667090/extras/d5a3f1b7c601ef37525caef10ec1326d.avif?t=1739840325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Woodrow the Old Piano</strong> is a novelty musical toy and MIDI player, using real sounds from a distressed antique piano. You can play this virtual piano using PC keys or a MIDI input device (such as a digital piano) or load in MIDI files to be automatically played pianola-style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on a real upright piano from the 1910s which has been sampled and remade in 3D, <strong>Woodrow the Old Piano</strong> is an out of tune piano simulator that resonates distressed, ragged sounds. Now you too can experience the ear-piercing noises of an out-of-shape antique piano without the inconvenience of stealing one from a haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Woodrow the Old Piano</strong> is a standalone musical toy, and not a plugin. Simply open it and enjoy! It's a fun virtual instrument to experiment with, and a charming gift for your musical friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play up to 85 keys from a real old-timey piano using your computer keyboard or a MIDI keyboard controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load in MIDI files for automated playback, pianola-style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features custom-made samples using real recordings from a distressed antique piano</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports sustain pedal (on/off) and velocity sensitivity (key volume)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D piano keys and pedal react as you press them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjust crispness and tune using Key Blend slider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete Steam achievements to prove your mastery of this old timer</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1667090/extras/d5a3f1b7c601ef37525caef10ec1326d.avif?t=1739840325\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Woodrow the Old Piano</strong> is a novelty musical toy and MIDI player, using real sounds from a distressed antique piano. You can play this virtual piano using PC keys or a MIDI input device (such as a digital piano) or load in MIDI files to be automatically played pianola-style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Based on a real upright piano from the 1910s which has been sampled and remade in 3D, <strong>Woodrow the Old Piano</strong> is an out of tune piano simulator that resonates distressed, ragged sounds. Now you too can experience the ear-piercing noises of an out-of-shape antique piano without the inconvenience of stealing one from a haunted house.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Woodrow the Old Piano</strong> is a standalone musical toy, and not a plugin. Simply open it and enjoy! It's a fun virtual instrument to experiment with, and a charming gift for your musical friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play up to 85 keys from a real old-timey piano using your computer keyboard or a MIDI keyboard controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Load in MIDI files for automated playback, pianola-style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Features custom-made samples using real recordings from a distressed antique piano</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Supports sustain pedal (on/off) and velocity sensitivity (key volume)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">3D piano keys and pedal react as you press them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adjust crispness and tune using Key Blend slider</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete Steam achievements to prove your mastery of this old timer</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Woodrow the Old Piano is a novelty musical toy and MIDI player, using real sounds from a distressed antique piano. Connect a keyboard controller or use your PC keys to play, or load in MIDI files for pianola-style playback, and enjoy the ear-piercing noises of this out-of-tune relic!",
